 "Hugo Rafael Martínez Poveda, né en 1941 à Moniquirá et mort le 22 mars 2020 à Bogota, est un policier colombien, directeur de l’unité spéciale Bloc de recherche, créée à la fin des années 80 pour abattre le narcotrafiquant colombien Pablo Escobar.": {
  "de": "fr",
  "ar": "Hugo Rafael Martínez Poveda, born in 1941 in Moniqirá and died on 22 March 2020 in Bogota, is a Colombian police officer, director of the special unit Bloc de recherche, created in the late 1980s to shoot down Colombian drug dealer Pablo Escobar.",
  "en": "Hugo Rafael Martínez Poveda, born in 1941 in Moniqirá and died on 22 March 2020 in Bogota, is a Colombian police officer, director of the special unit Bloc de recherche, created in the late 1980s to shoot down Colombian drug dealer Pablo Escobar."
 },
